---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="Engineer from Lagos — six years building full-stack software, mostly around money (fintech, crypto). Even more than that, I love building."
	pubDate={new Date('August 06 2026')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		I'm Bolarinwa, an engineer from Lagos, Nigeria. I've spent about six years building full-stack
		software — mostly using JavaScript and Golang — largely in and around money: fintech, crypto. I
		like that world, but even more than that, I love building.
	</p>

	<p>
		I tend to read a layer deeper than I strictly need to, and I can't really leave a rough edge
		alone — if the environment around me is painful, I'll probably end up fixing it. If there's a
		bug I'll fix it and make it harder to happen again. Lately I build AI-natively; the leverage is
		criminal sometimes. I'm usually partway down some new rabbit hole — recently somewhere between
		crypto and whatever the agentic era turns into.
	</p>

	<p>
		Away from the keyboard, I relax with strategy games — poker with friends, Clash Royale — and I
		box at my local gym.
	</p>

	<p>
		This corner of the internet is where I write things down: engineering, web3, and how building
		software is changing especially for me.
	</p>
</Layout>
